{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏iPhone Duo發售還不到一周時間，已有多名消費者反映內屏出現相似故障。內屏摺疊處出現裂紋，部分用户還遇到顯示異常等情況。<strong>就在今天，有網友反映，他的iPhone Duo外屏出現綠線，綠線位置跟短視頻App未適配的黑邊位置一致。該網友表示，手機沒有摔過也沒有磕碰，這應該是全網第一例外屏損壞的案例。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584012.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:01:44.591185+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:39:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.464434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.464434+00:00","content_hash":"044c2be81365899870ed9c24284fa743949cdcdf65d23a2444b29f44b4642c1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}